{"slug":"news/100k-context-windows","title":"Introducing 100K context windows \\ Anthropic","desc":"Claude's context window expands from 9K to 100K tokens, roughly 75,000 words, letting it process hundreds of pages in under a minute.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Introducing 100K context windows</h1></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2023-05-11\">May 11, 2023</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Category</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/news/product\">Product</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=context-engineering\">Context engineering</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=claude-developer-platform\">Claude Developer Platform</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=productivity\">Productivity</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=partnerships\">Partnerships</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1\">See more...</button></li></ul></div></header><div class=\"EaEYjq_ContentWrapper\"><div class=\"EaEYjq_ConstellationPanelSlot\"><aside style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"yApI1G_panel\"><div class=\"yApI1G_diagram\"><div class=\"_74-E